sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Detector as Regex Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over Orchestrator,Detector: Text Content Detection Flow

    Orchestrator->>Detector: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>Body: {contents: [{text}], detectors: {patterns}}
    activate Detector

    Note right of Detector: 1. Parse request JSON<br/>2. Resolve detector names<br/> (email, ssn, credit-card)<br/>3. Compile custom regexes<br/>4. Execute all patterns<br/>5. Collect matches with<br/> start/end offsets

    Detector-->>Orchestrator: 200 OK<br/>[{start, end, text,<br/>detection, detection_type,<br/>score: 1.0}]
    deactivate Detector

    Note over Orchestrator,Detector: Health Check Flow

    Orchestrator->>Detector: GET /health
    activate Detector
    Detector-->>Orchestrator: 200 OK "healthy"
    deactivate Detector
